    "start_seconds": 201.095,
    "end_seconds": 202.265,
    "text": "about, and I realize the only way"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.265",
    "end": "00:03:23.765",
    "start_seconds": 202.265,
    "end_seconds": 203.765,
    "text": "to get out of it is I have to leave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.335",
    "end": "00:03:25.745",
    "start_seconds": 204.335,
    "end_seconds": 205.745,
    "text": "So I tell the Trader Joe's employee,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.745",
    "end": "00:03:26.735",
    "start_seconds": 205.745,
    "end_seconds": 206.735,
    "text": "you don't need to call the police."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.735",
    "end": "00:03:27.245",
    "start_seconds": 206.735,
    "end_seconds": 207.245,
    "text": "I will leave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.245",
    "end": "00:03:28.415",
    "start_seconds": 207.245,
    "end_seconds": 208.415,
    "text": "I'll come back later as I leave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.415",
    "end": "00:03:29.675",
    "start_seconds": 208.415,
    "end_seconds": 209.675,
    "text": "She says, that's right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.675",
    "end": "00:03:30.185",
    "start_seconds": 209.675,
    "end_seconds": 210.185,
    "text": "Walk away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.185",
    "end": "00:03:31.775",
    "start_seconds": 210.185,
    "end_seconds": 211.775,
    "text": "And it is everything in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.775",
    "end": "00:03:33.095",
    "start_seconds": 211.775,
    "end_seconds": 213.095,
    "text": "me to not turn around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.165",
    "end": "00:03:35.385",
    "start_seconds": 213.165,
    "end_seconds": 215.385,
    "text": "Yeah, but I don't, I get in the car"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.385",
    "end": "00:03:37.454",
    "start_seconds": 215.385,
    "end_seconds": 217.454,
    "text": "and I drive home, and as I'm driving,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.454",
    "end": "00:03:38.954",
    "start_seconds": 217.454,
    "end_seconds": 218.954,
    "text": "I'm thinking about my wife and how she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.954",
    "end": "00:03:40.454",
    "start_seconds": 218.954,
    "end_seconds": 220.454,
    "text": "says this is a bad thing to do, but I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.454",
    "end": "00:03:44.295",
    "start_seconds": 220.454,
    "end_seconds": 224.29500000000002,
    "text": "think it's not because there's crazy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.295",
    "end": "00:03:46.215",
    "start_seconds": 224.29500000000002,
    "end_seconds": 226.215,
    "text": "people in the world that say terrible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.215",
    "end": "00:03:49.155",
    "start_seconds": 226.215,
    "end_seconds": 229.155,
    "text": "things and good decent people just"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.155",
    "end": "00:03:51.255",
    "start_seconds": 229.155,
    "end_seconds": 231.255,
    "text": "have to listen to it all the time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.704",
    "end": "00:03:52.454",
    "start_seconds": 231.704,
    "end_seconds": 232.454,
    "text": "And I just think."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.085",
    "end": "00:03:55.485",
    "start_seconds": 233.085,
    "end_seconds": 235.485,
    "text": "Maybe I can be the crazy person that says"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.485",
    "end": "00:03:57.465",
    "start_seconds": 235.485,
    "end_seconds": 237.465,
    "text": "the right thing to the other crazy people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.765",
    "end": "00:03:59.565",
    "start_seconds": 237.765,
    "end_seconds": 239.565,
    "text": "So maybe the next time she thinks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.565",
    "end": "00:04:00.855",
    "start_seconds": 239.565,
    "end_seconds": 240.855,
    "text": "about turning around, she'll think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.855",
    "end": "00:04:04.245",
    "start_seconds": 240.855,
    "end_seconds": 244.245,
    "text": "maybe I'm there, and maybe she'll stop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.415",
    "end": "00:04:06.795",
    "start_seconds": 245.415,
    "end_seconds": 246.795,
    "text": "I'm a social justice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.795",
    "end": "00:04:08.235",
    "start_seconds": 246.795,
    "end_seconds": 248.235,
    "text": "warrior, that's what I think."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.805",
    "end": "00:04:10.545",
    "start_seconds": 248.805,
    "end_seconds": 250.545,
    "text": "I think that until I turn onto"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.545",
    "end": "00:04:12.765",
    "start_seconds": 250.545,
    "end_seconds": 252.765,
    "text": "my street and I see our house and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.765",
    "end": "00:04:15.015",
    "start_seconds": 252.765,
    "end_seconds": 255.015,
    "text": "suddenly my body is filled with glee."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.885",
    "end": "00:04:17.474",
    "start_seconds": 255.885,
    "end_seconds": 257.474,
    "text": "I can't wait to tell my wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.474",
    "end": "00:04:18.584",
    "start_seconds": 257.474,
    "end_seconds": 258.584,
    "text": "what I just did, even though"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.584",
    "end": "00:04:19.755",
    "start_seconds": 258.584,
    "end_seconds": 259.755,
    "text": "I know she's gonna be mad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.755",
    "end": "00:04:23.534",
    "start_seconds": 259.755,
    "end_seconds": 263.534,
    "text": "I am so excited about it and it's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.534",
    "end": "00:04:27.104",
    "start_seconds": 263.534,
    "end_seconds": 267.104,
    "text": "that glee that makes me realize that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.104",
    "end": "00:04:29.205",
    "start_seconds": 267.104,
    "end_seconds": 269.205,
    "text": "I am not a social justice warrior."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.284",
    "end": "00:04:31.875",
    "start_seconds": 270.284,
    "end_seconds": 271.875,
    "text": "I just really love."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.385",
    "end": "00:04:35.895",
    "start_seconds": 272.385,
    "end_seconds": 275.895,
    "text": "To yell at people and make them feel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.895",
    "end": "00:04:38.745",
    "start_seconds": 275.895,
    "end_seconds": 278.745,
    "text": "bad when they deserve to feel bad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.975",
    "end": "00:04:41.295",
    "start_seconds": 279.975,
    "end_seconds": 281.295,
    "text": "As I'm driving towards my house,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.295",
    "end": "00:04:43.395",
    "start_seconds": 281.295,
    "end_seconds": 283.395,
    "text": "I realize that if the entire world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.395",
    "end": "00:04:46.305",
    "start_seconds": 283.395,
    "end_seconds": 286.305,
    "text": "suddenly became universally kind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.305",
    "end": "00:04:49.155",
    "start_seconds": 286.305,
    "end_seconds": 289.155,
    "text": "and benevolent, I would be upset."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.415",
    "end": "00:04:51.255",
    "start_seconds": 290.415,
    "end_seconds": 291.255,
    "text": "I would."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.085",
    "end": "00:04:54.735",
    "start_seconds": 293.085,
    "end_seconds": 294.735,
    "text": "As I pull into my driveway,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.245",
    "end": "00:04:57.525",
    "start_seconds": 295.245,
    "end_seconds": 297.525,
    "text": "I think I am really no better"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.525",
    "end": "00:04:59.145",
    "start_seconds": 297.525,
    "end_seconds": 299.145,
    "text": "than that lunatic in the line."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.145",
    "end": "00:05:02.355",
    "start_seconds": 299.145,
    "end_seconds": 302.355,
    "text": "I. Because I am not shouting at her"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.955",
    "end": "00:05:04.875",
    "start_seconds": 302.955,
    "end_seconds": 304.875,
    "text": "because I want the world to change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.595",
    "end": "00:05:07.455",
    "start_seconds": 305.595,
    "end_seconds": 307.455,
    "text": "I'm shouting at her because I really"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.455",
    "end": "00:05:09.765",
    "start_seconds": 307.455,
    "end_seconds": 309.765,
    "text": "like shouting at terrible people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.305",
    "end": "00:05:11.895",
    "start_seconds": 310.305,
    "end_seconds": 311.895,
    "text": "And if they were to all go away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.395",
    "end": "00:05:17.865",
    "start_seconds": 313.395,
    "end_seconds": 317.865,
    "text": "That would be a sad day for me, so my wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.865",
    "end": "00:05:20.565",
    "start_seconds": 317.865,
    "end_seconds": 320.565,
    "text": "is wi, my wife is right as she always is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.865",
    "end": "00:05:23.775",
    "start_seconds": 320.865,
    "end_seconds": 323.775,
    "text": "I need to shut my damn mouth and move"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.775",
    "end": "00:05:25.995",
    "start_seconds": 323.775,
    "end_seconds": 325.995,
    "text": "on in my life and be a better person."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.595",
    "end": "00:05:26.955",
    "start_seconds": 326.595,
    "end_seconds": 326.955,
    "text": "Thank you."
  }
]
